### 1. 先登录，获取管理员 Token
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "13800138001",
  "password": "123456"
}

> {% client.global.set("auth_token", response.body.data); %}

### 2. 发布活动（测试修复后的接口）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/activity/create
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "title": "测试活动-本地验证",
  "startTime": "2026-08-10 09:00:00",
  "endTime": "2026-08-10 12:00:00",
  "location": "龙胜村广场",
  "rewardPoints": 10,
  "description": "这是一个本地接口测试，验证时间格式问题是否修复",
  "maxParticipants": 50
}